    }
  ],
  "description": "Bounded-overload visibility: offered vs served, rejections per stage, per-stage saturation, loop lag, and resources -- the panels a guarded 2/4/8/16 load ramp is judged against (Load & Horizontal-Scaling Plan, Phase 2). All Prometheus-sourced; see 'Voice Agent KPIs' for the ClickHouse-backed caller-felt latency numbers.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 101,
      "title": "Offered vs served",
      "type": "row",
      "description": "What actually tried to reach the pipeline vs what got in. A generator's own schedule is offered demand, not proof it hit the server -- these panels are the edge's own count of attempts, before any admission decision (Phase 2)."
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus}"
      },
      "description": "attempts should equal admitted+rejected+upgrade_errors (+ any WebRTC/ICE negotiation failure between upgrade and the first audio track, which has no counter of its own). A gap between attempts and the rest means load never reached the edge's HTTP handler at all.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 102,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(edge_connection_attempts_total[1m])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "attempts/s"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(edge_sessions_total[1m])",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "admitted (sessions)/s"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(edge_connection_rejected_total[1m])",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "rejected (capacity)/s"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${prometheus}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(edge_ws_upgrade_errors_total[1m])",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "ws upgrade errors/s"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Connection attempts vs admitted vs rejected (edge)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus}"
      },
      "description": "Sessions can be connected and idle; turns is only the subset actually running LLM+TTS right now -- the distinction Phase 2's turn-admission gate exists for.",
